@Demo.Payment.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5123

### 创建支付单（取响应中的 id 用于下面的回调）
POST {{Demo.Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "o-1001",
  "amount": 10.5
}

### 查询支付单状态（替换为创建响应中的 id）
GET {{Demo.Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### 回调签名说明（payloadFormat / secret / 示例，演示用）
GET {{Demo.Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/payments/notify/sign-help
Accept: application/json

### HMAC 回调入账（paymentId 替换为创建响应中的 id）
# 签名：HMACSHA256(UTF8("paymentId|notifyId|amount|status"), UTF8("demo-payment-secret")) -> hex
# 可用 openssl 计算（与响应字段一致）：
#   openssl dgst -sha256 -hmac "demo-payment-secret" \
#     <(printf %s "<paymentId>|n-001|10.5|success")
POST {{Demo.Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/payments/notify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "notifyId": "n-001",
  "amount": 10.5,
  "status": "success",
  "signature": "在这里填入上面 payload 的 HMAC-SHA256 hex"
}

### 同一 notifyId 重发 → 幂等：200 + alreadyPaid，不重复入账
# 再次发送上一步相同的 Body 即可

### 签名不合法 → 401 "HMAC 签名校验失败"
POST {{Demo.Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/payments/notify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "notifyId": "n-002",
  "amount": 10.5,
  "status": "success",
  "signature": "DEADBEEF"
}

### 回调金额与支付单不一致 → 409 Conflict
# 把 amount 改为 99 并重算签名后发送

###
GET {{Demo.Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
